\newlabel{tab:supp_numbered}{{S6}{4}{Numbered-choice probe with GPT-4o ($n{=}20$ images per dataset). Free is the free-form prompt with strict regex extraction; Num.\ requests only an option number. Node accuracy is computed over each condition's own visited nodes, as in the main paper. All values are percentages}{table.6}{}}
